# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in your real key.
# Used only for local dev/testing, to seed a running test browser's
# Settings without typing the key by hand each time - see AGENTS.md
# section 3. The shipped extension itself cannot read this file; it
# still gets the key the one way a browser extension can, by storing
# it in chrome.storage.local via the Settings panel.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
